    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Partner Buggy are delighted to bring this historic picturesque bungalow in Coolaghmore, Callan, to the market. This four bedroom bungalow comprises c. 98.6 sqm of accommodation on a generous 0.64 acre site with a detached garage and outbuildings. \r\n\r\nThis idyllically located spacious property enjoys panoramic views of the Kilkenny countryside on all aspects. The presence of a rugged ask tree in the garden has links to historic Ireland. This feature tree is located a short stroll from a Mass Rock and was used as a lookout tree to warm the congregation of any approaching strangers, which is testament to the views enjoyed from this location.  \r\n\r\nConvenient location for easy access to local amenities being just 4.5km from Callan town, a mere 6 minute drive and just 20 mins drive to Kilkenny's vibrant city life. Callan is a busy & expanding town which offers a wide range of local amenities including a Supervalue, Aldi and a host of other shops. For commuters, the location offers easy access to the M9 motorway at Junctions 9 and 14.\r\n\r\nIts single - story bungalow layout is ideal for families  seeking rural charm. This property offers huge potential with regards to vacant property grants due to it being vacant for in excess of two years. It is a blank canvass and offers the discerning purchaser the opportunity to renovate and extend it, if desired into a modern family home. It truly does present a wonderful opportunity for those looking to make this location their forever home. \r\n \r\nViewing of this property is highly recommended, contact Property Partners Buggy to organise an appointment."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Comprising of 4 bedrooms, main bathroom, kitchen and living room. \r\nThe property offers approximately 1,061 sq. ft. of accommodation laid out on one floors as seen in the attached photos, high quality video and virtual tour with accompanying 3D model & floorplan that accompanies this brochure."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "- Spacious 4 bedroom property on a generous plot\r\n- Quiet rural setting with easy access to nearby Callan village & Kilkenny City schools and amenities. \r\n- Ideal family home, retirement retreat or holiday escape in the heart of the countryside\r\n- Ample parking and separate domestic garage along with a number of outbuildings \r\n- Scenic views with historic links\r\n\r\nSERVICES:\r\nOil fueled central heating and open fire\r\nPrivate Septic Tank\r\nGroup water scheme"
      },
      {
